# .swiftpm-locks/ is committed on purpose: it is the Kotlin Gradle plugin's SwiftPM lock
# (Package.resolved) and pins the transitive firebase-ios-sdk version so CI resolves the same
# graph as local builds. Its own .gitignore excludes the checkout.

